  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Emission of a positron results in the conversion of a proton into neutron, along with the release of neutrino. Thus, the number of protons decreases and of neutron increases, i.e. $n / p$ ratio increases and the nuclei becomes stable.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2014_che_a15.png\">",
